This folder is for the example graphs that ship with Graphviz
(share/graphviz/graphs/directed and .../undirected, version 14.1.2).
They are part of Graphviz, which is distributed under the Eclipse Public
License 1.0 (https://graphviz.org/license/), and they are not kept in this
repository. FILES lists the ones used, each with the SHA-256 of its
contents.

    bin/fetch-examples.py

copies them here from the Graphviz installed on this machine, checks each
against FILES, and asks Graphviz for its answers to them (into
oracle/graphviz/, which is not kept in the repository either). They are
test input only. Nothing in core/ derives from them.
